I think any shop will do - every shopkeeper can identify gems for you. 
And this is a special case of a more general abuse - if you have the 
spoiler file at hand, check the price of every article in the shop. The
price requested (or offered) is proportional to the worth given by the
spoiler file (the coefficient depends on your CHR - the exact function is
left as an exercise for the reader :-). Sometimes this allows to uniquely
identify the item (e.g. scroll of identify is the only one with worth 20),
and always it will reduce the multitude of possibilities.
